svg/regular and svg/filled are the MingCute core icons named by
Tellomi/Icons/mapping.csv. They are copied unchanged from the upstream
core-regular and core-filled sets (package @mingcute/svg 3.1.0).
Tellomi/Icons/generate_icons.py turns each one into a single-color
template PDF in the app asset catalog.
